/**
 * @file s2_geodesic_area.cpp
 * @brief Production-grade Spherical Excess Geodesic Polygon Area on WGS84 via Authalic Sphere.
 * 
 * Algorithm: 
 *   1. Project WGS84 (Lat, Lon) -> Authalic Sphere (Beta, Lambda) preserving area exactly.
 *   2. Convert Authalic coords -> 3D Unit Vectors (ECEF normalized).
 *   3. Compute Signed Spherical Excess via fan triangulation using the robust O'Neill/Girard 
